#. module: deltatech_sale_margin
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_sale_margin.field_res_config_settings__sale_margin_limit
msgid ""
"Margin percentage below which a sale order line is reported.\n"
"0 (default) reports only negative margins, i.e. strictly below the purchase price. A negative value tolerates a loss of up to that percentage without reporting it — useful when the warning would otherwise appear on so many orders that nobody reads it any more. A positive value also reports thin but positive margins."
msgstr ""

